    "enUS": {
      "description": "Hi, {name}.  Remember Tinkee Steamboil?  Well, she remembers you!  She sent me a message to keep an eye out for you, because... she needs your help again.  I think it has something to do with her studies on dragons.\n\nYou should speak to her in the Burning Steppes, at the Flame Crest.",
      "summary": "Speak with Tinkee Steamboil.",
      "title": "Tinkee Steamboil",
